<script setup lang="ts">import {ref,onMounted} from 'vue';import {groups} from '../stores/groups';import {canWrite} from '../stores/auth';import {useTask} from '../hooks/useTask';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import Notice from '../components/common/Notice.vue';const name=ref(''),stations=ref('城北,河西,临港,城南'),note=ref('');const {error,busy,act}=useTask();onMounted(groups.load);function submit(){act(async()=>{await groups.create({name:name.value,stations:stations.value.split(/[,，]/).map(v=>v.trim()).filter(Boolean),note:note.value});name.value=''})}</script><template><PageHeading eyebrow="ROUTE SCOPE / 02" title="让同一口径，覆盖同一组站。" note="线路组决定计算纳入哪些站点。独立保存范围，避免只在图表上临时过滤。"/><div class="two-col"><section><article v-for="row in groups.items.value" :key="row.id" class="group-row"><p class="eyebrow">ROUTE GROUP</p><h2>{{row.name}}</h2><div class="station-chain"><span v-for="s in row.stations" :key="s">{{s}}</span></div><p>{{row.note}}</p></article></section><form v-if="canWrite()" class="editor-panel" @submit.prevent="submit"><h2>建立线路组</h2><label>组名<input v-model="name" required minlength="2"></label><label>站点（逗号分隔）<input v-model="stations" required></label><label>范围说明<textarea v-model="note" rows="4"></textarea></label><Notice :message="error"/><button :disabled="busy">保存线路范围</button></form></div></template>
